        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_pro/scenes/missions/golden/mission_gecko/scene_gecko_basic.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository e1c8c0a5-a506-45b6-9567-7b6df50b8877).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning 47,\r\rOmar al-Ghazali, the celebrated architect of the Sceptre, is delivering a speech today that will seal his glorious future. Yet, as he captivates the masses, he conceals dark secrets: connections to corruption, deceit, and a clandestine organization.\r\rTake your position on the balcony across from the stage. From this height, you can make a precise shot without being detected. Ensure that no one sees you. It’s up to you to maintain the balance of power.\r\rGood luck!",
